WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,230 --> 00:00:03,950
You asked for God, you succeeded

2
00:00:04,150 --> 00:00:06,230
Damn him, die you white-eyed bastard

3
00:00:06,590 --> 00:00:07,590
Don't get excited, you two.

4
00:00:07,790 --> 00:00:09,550
Today is the day of competition between Tianjiao

5
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:11,990
Don't steal their limelight, that's right

6
00:00:12,310 --> 00:00:13,990
If you are not convinced

7
00:00:13,990 --> 00:00:16,950
Let their respective disciples compete to determine the winner.

8
00:00:17,270 --> 00:00:22,060
Just pray for them both

9
00:00:22,060 --> 00:00:24,180
Can survive in the secret realm

10
00:00:24,180 --> 00:00:25,740
Did you two hear that?

11
00:00:26,450 --> 00:00:28,690
I want the leader of the Celestial Clan to threaten you.

12
00:00:28,970 --> 00:00:30,210
what should you do

13
00:00:30,940 --> 00:00:31,900
Boss, rest assured

14
00:00:32,340 --> 00:00:33,860
As the Holy Son of Haoran Sect

15
00:00:34,060 --> 00:00:35,820
You must have a broad and vicious mind

16
00:00:35,820 --> 00:00:37,220
I just pretended I didn't hear anything

17
00:00:37,220 --> 00:00:39,580
Holy Son, this is not in line with your character.

18
00:00:39,580 --> 00:00:41,710
Don't ask

19
00:00:44,290 --> 00:00:45,850
I see you are scared

20
00:00:45,850 --> 00:00:47,570
Find yourself a place to go down the stairs.
